# Copy to `.dev.vars` for `npm run dev`. Never commit `.dev.vars` — the
# service-role key below bypasses every row-level policy in the project.
#
# SUPABASE_URL lives in wrangler.jsonc as a plain var; only the two keys are
# secrets, so only they are needed here.
#
# The publishable key is the one already in the desktop app's `.env`
# (VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY). The service-role key is in the Supabase
# dashboard under Project Settings → API keys; it is the long-lived JWT, not the
# publishable one, and the two are easy to confuse at a glance.
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
